```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Plan]
    B --> C[Retrieve]
    C --> D[Generate]
    D --> E[Critique]
    E -->|score < 0.8 and retries remain| D
    E -->|acceptable or max retries reached| F[Human approval]
    F -->|approved| G[Format]
    F -->|rejected| H[Revise]
    H --> D
    G --> I([End])
```